                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "First bench of the Quarry Road, trainer. Everything south of the marsh got cut by somebody swinging in rhythm. I keep the rhythm. Care to hear it up close?"
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Rock does not move for wishes. It moves for the pick and the count. One, two, swing. My team battles on the same count."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Deepcore is a long climb south and every step of it was cut by hand. Pay the road some respect — one bout with the keeper of its first bench."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Rovan Pickstride",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
